{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/7/917d2404f33c1a8f13a2d9d66137b17542a5f6a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{\\dfrac{a}{a+y}+\\dfrac{y}{a-y}}{\\dfrac{y}{a+y}-\\dfrac{a}{a-y}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -34px\" width=\"115\" height=\"77\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> real, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1cae493c4855ca1cdd17c420fc6a97ebc082b591.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, has the value <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> for:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/685591e0358fc717169a263685182850460ff635.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{all but two real values of }y \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{only two real values of }y \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{all real values of }y\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{only one real value of }y\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{no real values of }y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"229\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5ec6909aec674189db5b87a5d47d55455307ff8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\ne \\pm a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"17\" /> because that would make the denominator <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Create common denominators in the complex fraction.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/f/8cf56063c01adb0065e7b3eab7fed77b107946a1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\frac{a^2-ay}{a^2-y^2} + \\frac{ay+y^2}{a^2-y^2}}{\\frac{ay-y^2}{a^2-y^2} - \\frac{a^2+ay}{a^2-y^2}}\\]\" width=\"107\" height=\"57\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/5/e651d840609015650bd7b2d8ba98eb5d3e351a2b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\frac{a^2+y^2}{a^2-y^2}}{\\frac{-a^2-y^2}{a^2-y^2}}\\]\" width=\"52\" height=\"57\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b93542ba7ddfa6e5d5aa9ec642446b0c8fea7efc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b132c3806698e74eb3d74728da76fedbe2d813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + y^2 &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />, so no other restrictions need to be made.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/2/cb2fc0198000a78ecff147cd7f48f6ede12ff40d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a^2 + y^2}{a^2 - y^2} \\cdot \\frac{a^2 - y^2}{-a^2 - y^2}\\]\" width=\"144\" height=\"42\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/5/0459f6cd8a4e37c3fb48004a6dc77381d3243e4a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a^2 + y^2}{-(a^2 + y^2)}\\]\" width=\"85\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/7/fd7927352363a46a9414b895423eb31db1d10ae6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-1\\]\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" />\nThe expression (with suitable restrictions) simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Prob